{
  "uid": "simon-red",
  "title": "Simon · Métricas RED",
  "tags": ["simon", "otel", "red"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Servicio",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "definition": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, service)",
        "query": { "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, service)", "refId": "A" },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "Todos", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "De dónde salen estos números",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Tempo las deriva de los mismos spans que ya recibe — no hay instrumentación adicional. Cubren los dos servicios: **simon-workers** (pipeline) y **simon-web** (app en Vercel).\n\nSolo existen para spans llegados **después** de activar el metrics-generator, así que no hay histórico anterior al 2026-09-16. Para el detalle de una ejecución concreta, ve a Explore → Tempo."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Llamadas por segundo",
      "description": "traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, por nombre de span.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "auto", "pointSize": 8 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por span",
      "description": "Del histograma traces_spanmetrics_latency. Histogramas clásicos: los native histograms siguen siendo experimentales en Prometheus 2.53.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "auto", "pointSize": 8 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=~\"$service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans con error por segundo",
      "description": "status_code = STATUS_CODE_ERROR. Si esto sube, la tabla de fallos del dashboard de pipeline dice cuál.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "auto", "pointSize": 8 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service, span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\", service=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} · {{span_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Spans más frecuentes",
      "description": "Volumen acumulado en el rango. Sirve para saber qué domina el tráfico antes de optimizar nada.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 0, "fillOpacity": 90, "axisSoftMin": 0 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "always",
        "legend": { "showLegend": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (span_name) (increase(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"$service\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
